A. Commit message:
[3.2.x] Fixed CVE-2024-56374 -- Mitigated potential DoS in IPv6 validation.

B. Change summary:
The max_length parameter has been set to 39 for GenericIPAddressField in both forms and models to prevent denial-of-service attacks due to overly long IPv6 strings. Added validation to ensure the value's length does not exceed this limit. Updated test cases to reflect these changes, ensuring proper handling of valid and invalid IPv6 addresses with respect to the new length restriction.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

